<ServicePage title="Shop fit-outs" heading="Shop and commercial fit-outs"
  description="Retail and commercial fit-outs in Noosa and the Sunshine Coast by a QBCC licensed builder."
  intro="Retail and commercial fit-outs: walls and partitions, counters and joinery, ceilings and the finishing work that makes a space ready to trade."
  trades={['Fit-outs']}
  cta="Fitting out a shop or office? Send us the plans or tell us what you need.">
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Shop fit-outs</li>
    <li>Partition walls and ceilings</li>
    <li>Counters, shelving and joinery</li>
    <li>Make-good work at the end of a lease</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How a job runs</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><strong>Plans and site visit.</strong> We look at the tenancy and your plans, or help you work out what you need.</li>
    <li><strong>Scope and quote.</strong> A written scope and quote, including what the landlord or centre requires.</li>
    <li><strong>Program.</strong> We agree a start date, the order of work and when the space needs to be ready.</li>
    <li><strong>Build and handover.</strong> We run the trades and hand the space over ready to fit with stock and furniture.</li>
  </ol>
  <Todo>check the fit-out list and steps match the work you take on (e.g. do we do make-good work?)</Todo>
  <Todo slot="no-photos">finished fit-out photos go here, with the client’s OK</Todo>
</ServicePage>
